            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mt-5">21. Lists Inside a List Item</h2>

            <p>
                A list item can contain paragraphs, links, images, and even
                another list.
            </p>

            <pre><code>&lt;ul&gt;

    &lt;li&gt;

        Web Development

        &lt;p&gt;
            Learn modern web development technologies.
        &lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;Frontend&lt;/li&gt;
